1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
What's today's video about? It's about conversations at beauty salons and barbershops. Talking can be risky, you know!

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,008
Scene 1: The Basics of Customer Service

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:15,674
Welcome!

4
00:00:15,697 --> 00:00:19,330
Do you have a reservation?

5
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:23,687
Yes, I made one for 10 o'clock.

6
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:26,343
I'm Yamada.

7
00:00:26,366 --> 00:00:29,033
Mr. Yamada, correct?

8
00:00:29,056 --> 00:00:32,325
We've been expecting you.

9
00:00:32,348 --> 00:00:34,983
Nice to meet you.

10
00:00:35,007 --> 00:00:38,907
May I take your belongings?

11
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:42,087
Yes, please.

12
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:44,745
This bag.

13
00:00:44,769 --> 00:00:48,736
Shall I take your jacket as well?

14
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:52,638
Oh, yes. Please do.

15
00:00:52,661 --> 00:00:55,765
Right this way.

16
00:00:55,788 --> 00:00:58,545
I'll show you to your seat.

17
00:00:58,569 --> 00:01:01,207
Thank you.

18
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:04,897
Lovely weather today, isn't it?

19
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,858
Yes, it is.

20
00:01:07,881 --> 00:01:11,715
A little hot, though.

21
00:01:11,737 --> 00:01:15,571
Yes, it's hot outside.

22
00:01:15,594 --> 00:01:19,627
But it's nice and cool in here.

23
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:22,150
That's great.

24
00:01:22,173 --> 00:01:25,673
Would you like something to drink?

25
00:01:25,696 --> 00:01:29,037
Water, please.

26
00:01:29,061 --> 00:01:31,928
Certainly.

27
00:01:31,951 --> 00:01:35,817
I'll bring you some cold water.

28
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:38,474
Thank you.

29
00:01:38,497 --> 00:01:41,063
That would be great.

30
00:01:41,086 --> 00:01:45,228
Your stylist will be with you shortly.

31
00:01:45,252 --> 00:01:48,752
Okay, I'll wait.

32
00:01:48,775 --> 00:01:51,710
Please wait just a moment.

33
00:01:51,733 --> 00:01:54,600
Understood.

34
00:01:54,623 --> 00:02:01,728
You can review today's video with the link in the description and top comment. *Note: The site may be deleted without notice.

35
00:02:01,728 --> 00:02:04,728
Scene 2: How to Check Waiting Time

36
00:02:04,728 --> 00:02:08,028
Welcome!

37
00:02:08,051 --> 00:02:10,751
Excuse me,

38
00:02:10,774 --> 00:02:16,130
I don't have a reservation. Is that okay?

39
00:02:16,153 --> 00:02:20,526
Yes, that's fine.

40
00:02:20,550 --> 00:02:24,716
Is it busy right now?

41
00:02:24,739 --> 00:02:27,673
Yes, it is.

42
00:02:27,697 --> 00:02:32,364
There are two customers ahead of you.

43
00:02:32,387 --> 00:02:36,464
How long will it take?

44
00:02:36,488 --> 00:02:40,397
About 30 minutes.

45
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:43,171
Understood.

46
00:02:43,195 --> 00:02:45,361
I'll wait.

47
00:02:45,384 --> 00:02:50,418
Please have a seat over there and wait.

48
00:02:50,441 --> 00:02:56,074
Can I read a magazine while I wait?

49
00:02:56,097 --> 00:02:59,130
Of course.

50
00:02:59,153 --> 00:03:01,420
Go ahead.

51
00:03:01,443 --> 00:03:04,309
Thank you.

52
00:03:04,332 --> 00:03:09,847
It's been quite rainy this season, hasn't it?

53
00:03:09,871 --> 00:03:14,337
Yes, it rains a lot.

54
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:17,929
Do you have an umbrella?

55
00:03:17,952 --> 00:03:21,622
Yes, I do.

56
00:03:21,646 --> 00:03:25,821
The umbrella stand is next to the door.

57
00:03:25,844 --> 00:03:29,678
Oh, I'll leave it there.

58
00:03:29,701 --> 00:03:32,697
Sorry to keep you waiting.

59
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:36,359
Next, please.

60
00:03:36,383 --> 00:03:39,549
Yes, that's me.

61
00:03:39,572 --> 00:03:43,521
Please take a seat here.

62
00:03:43,544 --> 00:03:47,111
Nice to meet you.

63
00:03:47,134 --> 00:03:57,142
Let me know if you can hear me by leaving a comment.

64
00:03:57,142 --> 00:04:00,142
Scene 3: Transform Your Look – How to Change Your Hairstyle and Hair Color

65
00:04:00,142 --> 00:04:05,009
What kind of hairstyle would you like today?

66
00:04:05,032 --> 00:04:09,965
I'd like it a little shorter.

67
00:04:09,988 --> 00:04:13,488
How much would you like me to trim?

68
00:04:13,511 --> 00:04:18,883
Please cut about 3 centimeters all over.

69
00:04:18,907 --> 00:04:21,479
Understood.

70
00:04:21,503 --> 00:04:25,437
What about your bangs?

71
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:31,360
Just above the eyes is fine for my bangs.

72
00:04:31,383 --> 00:04:33,928
Certainly.

73
00:04:33,951 --> 00:04:37,950
Would you like to change your hair color as well?

74
00:04:37,974 --> 00:04:43,333
Yes, I'd like something a bit lighter.

75
00:04:43,356 --> 00:04:47,189
How about this color in the photo?

76
00:04:47,212 --> 00:04:49,916
That looks great!

77
00:04:49,939 --> 00:04:53,514
I'll go with that color, please.

78
00:04:53,538 --> 00:04:56,857
Would you like a perm as well?

79
00:04:56,880 --> 00:05:01,113
No, I don't want a perm.

80
00:05:01,136 --> 00:05:03,670
Understood.

81
00:05:03,692 --> 00:05:07,192
So, just a haircut and color, right?

82
00:05:07,216 --> 00:05:09,449
Yes.

83
00:05:09,472 --> 00:05:12,550
How much will that be?

84
00:05:12,574 --> 00:05:16,974
That'll be 8,000 yen in total.

85
00:05:16,997 --> 00:05:21,264
How long will it take?

86
00:05:21,287 --> 00:05:24,953
It'll take about 2 hours.

87
00:05:24,976 --> 00:05:27,476
Understood.

88
00:05:27,499 --> 00:05:29,809
That's fine.

89
00:05:29,833 --> 00:05:33,009
Alright, let's get started.

90
00:05:33,033 --> 00:05:35,982
Nice to meet you.

91
00:05:36,005 --> 00:05:41,705
If anything feels off, just let me know.

92
00:05:41,728 --> 00:05:45,231
Okay, I will.

93
00:05:45,254 --> 00:05:48,254
Scene 4: Perfecting Your Cut – Haircut Instructions

94
00:05:48,254 --> 00:05:52,087
What would you like done today?

95
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:55,810
Same as usual, please.

96
00:05:55,833 --> 00:06:00,733
I'll keep the sides and back short.

97
00:06:00,757 --> 00:06:05,790
Yes, please use the clippers.

98
00:06:05,813 --> 00:06:10,154
What clipper guard should I use?

99
00:06:10,177 --> 00:06:14,557
Please use a number 6 guard to shorten it.

100
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:18,847
Do you want to keep the top long?

101
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:24,207
No, trim the top a little as well.

102
00:06:24,231 --> 00:06:27,097
Certainly.

103
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:30,877
How about your sideburns?

104
00:06:30,901 --> 00:06:34,735
Just a regular length, please.

105
00:06:34,758 --> 00:06:37,991
Understood.

106
00:06:38,014 --> 00:06:42,781
Should I clean up around the ears?

107
00:06:42,804 --> 00:06:48,870
Yes, make sure no hair touches the ears.

108
00:06:48,893 --> 00:06:52,685
How would you like the neckline shaped?

109
00:06:52,709 --> 00:06:56,613
Keep it natural, please.

110
00:06:56,636 --> 00:06:59,307
Understood.

111
00:06:59,330 --> 00:07:02,597
You're getting a shave as well, right?

112
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:08,053
Yes, I love a good shave—please do that too.

113
00:07:08,076 --> 00:07:12,111
Should I tidy up your eyebrows as well?

114
00:07:12,134 --> 00:07:17,077
Yes, make them a little thinner, please.

115
00:07:17,101 --> 00:07:19,801
Certainly.

116
00:07:19,824 --> 00:07:22,973
Alright, let's get started with the cut.

117
00:07:22,997 --> 00:07:26,830
Nice to meet you.

118
00:07:26,853 --> 00:07:31,286
If it hurts at all, please let me know right away.

119
00:07:31,309 --> 00:07:35,178
Okay, I will.

120
00:07:35,202 --> 00:07:38,202
Scene 5: A Relaxing Hair Wash at the Salon

121
00:07:38,202 --> 00:07:42,502
I'll show you to the shampoo station.

122
00:07:42,525 --> 00:07:45,002
Yes.

123
00:07:45,025 --> 00:07:48,925
Please have a seat in this chair.

124
00:07:48,948 --> 00:07:52,505
Okay, I'll sit down.

125
00:07:52,529 --> 00:07:56,196
I'll recline the chair now.

126
00:07:56,219 --> 00:07:58,919
Understood.

127
00:07:58,942 --> 00:08:02,442
Is your neck feeling okay?

128
00:08:02,465 --> 00:08:06,098
Yes, I'm fine.

129
00:08:06,121 --> 00:08:09,754
How's the water temperature?

130
00:08:09,777 --> 00:08:12,856
It's just right.

131
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:17,813
Not too hot or too cold?

132
00:08:17,836 --> 00:08:21,569
No issues at all.

133
00:08:21,593 --> 00:08:25,426
Alright, I'll start washing your hair now.

134
00:08:25,449 --> 00:08:27,882
Please do.

135
00:08:27,905 --> 00:08:32,057
How's the pressure?

136
00:08:32,081 --> 00:08:36,435
A little stronger would be great.

137
00:08:36,458 --> 00:08:40,425
How about this pressure?

138
00:08:40,448 --> 00:08:44,915
Oh, that feels amazing!

139
00:08:44,938 --> 00:08:48,639
No itchy spots?

140
00:08:48,662 --> 00:08:51,581
That's fine.

141
00:08:51,605 --> 00:08:55,146
Now, I'll rinse your hair.

142
00:08:55,169 --> 00:08:57,035
Yes.

143
00:08:57,058 --> 00:08:59,976
All done—thank you for your patience!

144
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:03,136
Let's head back to your seat.

145
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:06,593
Thank you so much.

146
00:09:06,616 --> 00:09:09,616
Scene 6: Nonstop Workdays and a Soothing Onsen Escape

147
00:09:09,616 --> 00:09:14,649
Has work been busy for you lately?

148
00:09:14,672 --> 00:09:16,811
Yes.

149
00:09:16,835 --> 00:09:21,402
I've been working overtime every day.

150
00:09:21,425 --> 00:09:24,812
That sounds tough.

151
00:09:24,836 --> 00:09:28,503
Do you get any days off?

152
00:09:28,526 --> 00:09:35,433
I have weekends off, but I just sleep the whole time—I'm so exhausted.

153
00:09:35,456 --> 00:09:40,589
You should take some time to recharge.

154
00:09:40,612 --> 00:09:42,920
Yes, it is.

155
00:09:42,944 --> 00:09:46,914
I'd love to go somewhere.

156
00:09:46,937 --> 00:09:50,576
How about an onsen getaway?

157
00:09:50,599 --> 00:09:53,333
That looks great!

158
00:09:53,356 --> 00:09:58,189
I'd love to soak in an onsen and unwind.

159
00:09:58,212 --> 00:10:04,118
There's a new onsen that just opened nearby.

160
00:10:04,142 --> 00:10:06,375
Really?

161
00:10:06,398 --> 00:10:09,316
I had no idea!

162
00:10:09,339 --> 00:10:14,607
Yes, I hear it's beautiful and spacious.

163
00:10:14,631 --> 00:10:19,185
Maybe I'll check it out this weekend.

164
00:10:19,209 --> 00:10:22,709
You should definitely go!

165
00:10:22,731 --> 00:10:28,604
By the way, how long has this salon been open?

166
00:10:28,628 --> 00:10:32,528
We've been here for twenty years now.

167
00:10:32,551 --> 00:10:35,489
That's incredible!

168
00:10:35,512 --> 00:10:38,250
That's a long time.

169
00:10:38,274 --> 00:10:43,818
Thanks to our loyal customers, we've been able to keep going.

170
00:10:43,841 --> 00:10:49,107
I really love the atmosphere here.

171
00:10:49,130 --> 00:10:51,604
Thank you.

172
00:10:51,628 --> 00:10:55,062
That makes me so happy to hear.

173
00:10:55,085 --> 00:10:58,318
I'll keep coming back.

174
00:10:58,341 --> 00:11:01,315
We'll be waiting for you!

175
00:11:01,339 --> 00:11:04,605
Nice to meet you.

176
00:11:04,628 --> 00:11:07,628
Scene 7: Ways to Unwind While Applying Medication

177
00:11:07,628 --> 00:11:13,662
I'll apply the color treatment now.

178
00:11:13,685 --> 00:11:17,318
Yes, please.

179
00:11:17,341 --> 00:11:21,608
Does it sting your scalp?

180
00:11:21,631 --> 00:11:26,331
It's fine so far.

181
00:11:26,354 --> 00:11:31,632
If it starts to hurt, let me know right away, okay?

182
00:11:31,655 --> 00:11:35,171
Okay, I will.

183
00:11:35,195 --> 00:11:40,152
Would you like to read a magazine or use a tablet?

184
00:11:40,175 --> 00:11:44,209
Could I borrow the tablet, please?

185
00:11:44,232 --> 00:11:47,365
Here you go.

186
00:11:47,388 --> 00:11:50,721
You can even watch videos on it.

187
00:11:50,744 --> 00:11:54,011
Thank you.

188
00:11:54,034 --> 00:11:57,586
I think I'll watch a movie.

189
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:01,676
Would you like some coffee or tea?

190
00:12:01,699 --> 00:12:06,893
Iced coffee, please.

191
00:12:06,917 --> 00:12:11,250
Would you like milk or sugar with that?

192
00:12:11,273 --> 00:12:15,173
Just milk, please.

193
00:12:15,196 --> 00:12:18,229
Certainly.

194
00:12:18,252 --> 00:12:21,352
Sorry to keep you waiting.

195
00:12:21,375 --> 00:12:24,609
Here's your iced coffee.

196
00:12:24,632 --> 00:12:27,498
Thank you.

197
00:12:27,521 --> 00:12:30,155
Thank you.

198
00:12:30,178 --> 00:12:36,411
We'll wait about twenty minutes for the color to set.

199
00:12:36,434 --> 00:12:41,209
Okay, I'll relax in the meantime.

200
00:12:41,232 --> 00:12:43,932
Are you cold?

201
00:12:43,955 --> 00:12:48,748
Would you like a blanket?

202
00:12:48,771 --> 00:12:51,742
That's fine.

203
00:12:51,766 --> 00:12:54,599
I'm not cold, thanks.

204
00:12:54,622 --> 00:12:59,603
If you need anything, just let me know.

205
00:12:59,627 --> 00:13:03,606
Thank you so much.

206
00:13:03,629 --> 00:13:06,629
Scene 8: Basic Steps of Face Shaving

207
00:13:06,629 --> 00:13:12,096
Next, I'll shave your face.

208
00:13:12,119 --> 00:13:15,152
I'll recline your chair now.

209
00:13:15,175 --> 00:13:18,509
Yes, please.

210
00:13:18,532 --> 00:13:23,765
I'll place a warm towel on your face.

211
00:13:23,788 --> 00:13:28,130
Oh, that feels so good.

212
00:13:28,153 --> 00:13:31,490
Is it too hot?

213
00:13:31,513 --> 00:13:36,111
No, it's just the right temperature.

214
00:13:36,135 --> 00:13:40,534
I'll apply some shaving cream now.

215
00:13:40,558 --> 00:13:45,430
How does your skin feel?

216
00:13:45,453 --> 00:13:48,645
Is it irritated at all?

217
00:13:48,669 --> 00:13:53,606
It might be a little dry.

218
00:13:53,629 --> 00:13:59,096
I'll shave gently then.

219
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,713
Thank you.

220
00:14:01,736 --> 00:14:05,869
Does this hurt anywhere?

221
00:14:05,892 --> 00:14:08,426
That's fine.

222
00:14:08,449 --> 00:14:11,834
You're really good at this.

223
00:14:11,857 --> 00:14:15,090
Thank you.

224
00:14:15,113 --> 00:14:19,068
I do this every day.

225
00:14:19,092 --> 00:14:21,792
That makes sense.

226
00:14:21,815 --> 00:14:24,515
You're a pro!

227
00:14:24,538 --> 00:14:28,497
I'll shave under your chin now.

228
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:32,255
Please tilt your head up slightly.

229
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:36,446
Like this?

230
00:14:36,469 --> 00:14:40,102
Yes, that's perfect.

231
00:14:40,125 --> 00:14:43,392
We're almost done.

232
00:14:43,415 --> 00:14:48,348
I'm starting to feel sleepy.

233
00:14:48,371 --> 00:14:51,604
Just relax and take it easy.

234
00:14:51,627 --> 00:14:53,961
Yes.

235
00:14:53,984 --> 00:14:56,984
Scene 9: Hair Styling at the Salon

236
00:14:56,984 --> 00:15:01,022
I'll dry your hair now.

237
00:15:01,046 --> 00:15:04,112
Yes, please.

238
00:15:04,135 --> 00:15:08,091
The color turned out beautifully!

239
00:15:08,114 --> 00:15:11,056
It really did!

240
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:14,352
I really like it!

241
00:15:14,375 --> 00:15:18,150
I'll style it now.

242
00:15:18,173 --> 00:15:21,806
Should I apply some wax?

243
00:15:21,829 --> 00:15:26,096
Yes, just a little, please.

244
00:15:26,119 --> 00:15:30,752
Do you usually style your hair yourself?

245
00:15:30,775 --> 00:15:36,342
Yes, but I'm not very good at it.

246
00:15:36,366 --> 00:15:41,000
This wax is really easy to use.

247
00:15:41,023 --> 00:15:44,489
How do I use it?

248
00:15:44,512 --> 00:15:50,903
Take a little on your hands and work it through your hair.

249
00:15:50,927 --> 00:15:55,098
I see. That sounds simple.

250
00:15:55,122 --> 00:16:00,188
Just apply a tiny bit to your bangs last.

251
00:16:00,211 --> 00:16:03,002
Understood.

252
00:16:03,026 --> 00:16:06,393
I'll give it a try tomorrow.

253
00:16:06,416 --> 00:16:11,887
Using hair oil will make your hair look even better.

254
00:16:11,911 --> 00:16:15,064
Really?

255
00:16:15,087 --> 00:16:18,621
What kind of oil is good?

256
00:16:18,644 --> 00:16:23,746
I recommend the ones sold at the store.

257
00:16:23,769 --> 00:16:27,545
Then I'll buy one too.

258
00:16:27,568 --> 00:16:30,342
Thank you.

259
00:16:30,366 --> 00:16:35,119
Now, check the back in the mirror.

260
00:16:35,142 --> 00:16:37,928
That looks great!

261
00:16:37,952 --> 00:16:40,660
Perfect!

262
00:16:40,683 --> 00:16:43,550
That's great.

263
00:16:43,573 --> 00:16:46,206
All done—thank you for your patience!

264
00:16:46,229 --> 00:16:49,962
Thank you so much.

265
00:16:49,985 --> 00:16:52,985
Scene 10: Haircut and Massage at the Barbershop

266
00:16:52,985 --> 00:16:56,219
Your haircut is done.

267
00:16:56,242 --> 00:16:59,579
How does the back look?

268
00:16:59,602 --> 00:17:03,584
Let me see in the mirror.

269
00:17:03,608 --> 00:17:07,204
Here you go.

270
00:17:07,227 --> 00:17:09,927
It looks like this.

271
00:17:09,950 --> 00:17:13,183
It feels so fresh!

272
00:17:13,206 --> 00:17:16,939
The length is just right.

273
00:17:16,962 --> 00:17:19,944
I'm glad you like it.

274
00:17:19,968 --> 00:17:23,534
I'll give you a shoulder massage now.

275
00:17:23,557 --> 00:17:26,424
Please do.

276
00:17:26,447 --> 00:17:30,204
Oh, right there!

277
00:17:30,228 --> 00:17:33,328
That feels amazing.

278
00:17:33,351 --> 00:17:37,741
Your shoulders are a little stiff.

279
00:17:37,764 --> 00:17:44,064
Yeah, I've been using the computer a lot lately.

280
00:17:44,087 --> 00:17:47,038
You must be tired.

281
00:17:47,062 --> 00:17:51,295
Make sure to rest well.

282
00:17:51,318 --> 00:17:55,152
Thank you so much.

283
00:17:55,175 --> 00:17:59,369
Now, let's settle the bill.

284
00:17:59,392 --> 00:18:02,359
Please head to the register.

285
00:18:02,382 --> 00:18:05,882
Okay. How much is it?

286
00:18:05,905 --> 00:18:12,300
The haircut and shave come to 4,500 yen.

287
00:18:12,323 --> 00:18:16,590
Can I pay with a credit card?

288
00:18:16,613 --> 00:18:20,946
Yes, we accept cards.

289
00:18:20,969 --> 00:18:26,003
Then I'll pay by card.

290
00:18:26,026 --> 00:18:28,665
Understood.

291
00:18:28,688 --> 00:18:33,054
Please enter your PIN here.

292
00:18:33,077 --> 00:18:35,911
Yes.

293
00:18:35,934 --> 00:18:38,846
Thank you.

294
00:18:38,869 --> 00:18:43,373
Here's your card and receipt.

295
00:18:43,397 --> 00:18:46,332
Thank you.

296
00:18:46,356 --> 00:18:51,889
We recommend coming back in about a month.

297
00:18:51,912 --> 00:18:54,613
Understood.

298
00:18:54,637 --> 00:18:57,273
I'll be back.

299
00:18:57,296 --> 00:19:00,363
Thank you so much.

300
00:19:00,386 --> 00:19:03,252
Take care.

301
00:19:03,275 --> 00:19:06,209
Goodbye.